# Cloud verify (not laptop midwife)

**Default:** Run automated tests and product lookchecks in a **Cloud Agent
environment** (Cursor-hosted Ubuntu or self-hosted Mac worker). Do not treat
local Agent chat as the place that runs the full suite / UI look.

Normative: `docs/ops/CLOUD-AGENT-VERIFY.md` · public `AGENTS.md`.

- Multi-repo env: `mcp-watchdog` + `mcp-watchdog-ops` (single-repo public
  tokens 404 ops).
- Cloud checklist: lint · format:check · compile · test:unit · build ·
  test:host · smoke (when needed) · computer-use screenshots/artifacts.
- Self-hosted Mac worker = still a Cloud Agent (for real Cursor F5 / GIF).
- Local F5 in a chat session = SIGN-OFF capture fallback only when TESTING
  requires it and no self-hosted worker is available.
- Never paste private ops into public stubs. No spend. No social posts.
